==Battleground==
*20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns.
**5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns.
**4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**5 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**5 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 1 seconds<sup>30f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 134 seconds<sup>4,020f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 134.67 seconds<sup>4,040f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Condemned Peng and Devil Wife aren't threats given how many Surge Immune units should be in your lineup, and [[Barrel Cat]] should be able to Pierce Wicked Face's Shield. [[Awakened Naala]] happens to be Wave Immune, so you can abuse both Miz Devil and Aku Doge as a stepping stone while Naala shreds this stage. Aku Gory, if he doesn't die to Naala, can be taken care of using [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], [[Ape Lord Luza]] or [[Can Can Cat]].

